    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Brazil Estate Agents are delighted to present for sale ‘Apartment 44’ Les Buissonnets, this is a bright and generously proportioned two-bedroom, two-bathroom apartment occupying an attractive second-floor position within this highly regarded development in the heart of Blackrock.\r\n\r\nThe apartment offers spacious and well-balanced accommodation beginning with a welcoming entrance hall with an intercom entry system and useful storage. The hall leads to a particularly generous open-plan living and dining room with ample space for separate seating and dining areas.\r\n\r\nFull-height glazed doors provide excellent natural light and open directly onto a substantial private balcony. The balcony comfortably accommodates outdoor furniture and enjoys an attractive elevated outlook over the landscaped communal gardens and neighbouring stone church.\r\n\r\nThe separate kitchen is fitted with an extensive range of timber wall and floor units, generous worktop space, tiled splashback and tiled flooring. Appliances include an integrated oven and ceramic hob, with provision for a washing machine and fridge/freezer.\r\n\r\nThere are two well-proportioned double bedrooms. The master bedroom benefits from an extensive range of fitted wardrobes and an ensuite shower room. A separate main bathroom is fitted with a bath, glazed shower screen, overhead rainfall-style mixer shower, pedestal wash-hand basin and WC.\r\n\r\nPresented in good, well-maintained condition, ‘Apartment 44’ offers an appealing combination of generous accommodation, two bathrooms, a substantial private balcony and an exceptionally convenient Blackrock location.\r\n\r\nLes Buissonnets is situated within a short walk of Blackrock Village, Blackrock and Frascati shopping centres, cafés, restaurants and numerous local amenities. Blackrock DART station and several Dublin Bus routes provide convenient access to Dublin city centre.\r\n\r\nThe coastal walks at Blackrock and Seapoint are readily accessible, while UCD Smurfit Business School and several highly regarded schools are also located nearby.\r\n\r\nThe property is ideally suited to owner-occupiers, downsizers and investors seeking a spacious apartment in one of South Dublin’s most desirable and convenient locations."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Bright and spacious entrance hall with timber-effect flooring, intercom entry system, access to the principal rooms and useful storage accommodation.\r\nLiving Diningroom\r\nGenerously proportioned open plan living and dining room with timber effect flooring,intercomentry syste, access to the principal roomsand usefull storage space. \r\nLiving/ Diningroom\r\nGenerously proportioned open-plan living and dining room with timber-effect flooring and ample space for seperate seating and dining areas. Full height glazed doors provide excellent natural light and open directly onto the private balcony.\r\nKitchen\r\nSeperate fitted kitchen incorporating an extensive range of timber wall and floor units,generous worktop space, tiled splashback, tiled floor and stainless-steel  sink . Intergated ovenand ceramic hob ,with provision for a washing machine and fridge freezer.\r\n\r\nPrinciple Bedroom\r\nSpacious double bedroom with an extensive range of fitted wardrobes and access to a private ensuite shower room.\r\nEnsuite\r\nFitted with shower, wash-hand basin and wc.\r\n\r\nBedroom Two\r\nBright and well-proportioned double bedroom suitable for use as a bedroom ,guest roomor home office.\r\nMain Bathroom\r\nMain bathroom fitted with a bath ,glazed shower screen,overhead rainfall-style mixer shower,pedestalwash-hand basinand wc. Tiled floor and partially tiled wales.\r\nBalcony\r\nSubstancial private balcony with amplespace for outdood seating and an attractive elevated outlook over the landscaped communal gardens and neighbouring stone church."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Spacious two-bedroom, two-bathroom apartment\r\n\r\nAttractive second-floor position\r\n\r\nMaster bedroom with ensuite shower room\r\n\r\nSeparate main bathroom with bath and overhead mixer shower\r\n\r\nGenerously proportioned living and dining room\r\n\r\nSubstantial private balcony\r\n\r\nAttractive elevated outlook over the communal gardens and neighbouring stone church\r\n\r\nTwo well-proportioned double bedrooms\r\n\r\nExtensive fitted wardrobes\r\n\r\nSeparate fully fitted kitchen\r\n\r\nElectric heating\r\n\r\nIntercom entry system\r\n\r\nLandscaped communal gardens\r\n\r\nLift access\r\n\r\nSecure underground parking space, subject to confirmation\r\n\r\nApproximately three minutes’ walk from Blackrock Village\r\n\r\nBlackrock DART station within easy walking distance\r\n\r\nConvenient to Blackrock and Frascati shopping centres\r\n\r\nExcellent public transport connections\r\n\r\nSuitable for owner-occupiers, downsizers and investors"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
