      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "From Blackrock Village , proceed towards Frascati Road and turn onto Sweetmans Avenue. Les Buissonnets is located a short distance along Sweetmans Avenue, opposite Blackrock Garda Station . On entering the development,follow the sighns for appartment 44."
